# LOCAL-ONLY, NOT SECRET (platform.md §1, D-022). The worker service only, on top of compose.env (TASK-014,
# PR13-SEC-08/-06, PR3-SEC-06): its Valkey ACL user and the audit-anchor signing key (worker-only holder, ADR-0018).
# Checked by tools/config/compose-env.test.ts.

REDIS_URL=redis://worker:local-only-valkey-worker-password@redis:6379

AUDIT_ANCHOR_SIGNING_KEY=audit-anchor-v1:local-only-audit-anchor-signing-key
